  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0df435145b65a3a5",
      "translationZh": "Arm 推出的下一代 AI 驱动型分辨率提升解决方案 Neural Super Sampling (NSS) 现已发布，图形与游戏开发者今天就可以开始试用！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a11d9e320ded31de",
      "translationZh": "借助机器学习实现提升",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da6fb30c52e7b043",
      "translationZh": "NSS 旨在为未来搭载 Arm Neural Technology 的移动设备提供实时性能。不过，延迟取决于 GPU 配置、分辨率和使用场景等实现因素。在下方的 Enchanted Castle 演示视频中，NSS 将 GPU 工作负载降低了 50%。在持续性能设置下，该模型以 540p 渲染，并在仅 4ms 内将分辨率提升至 1080p。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "04c37ab2e0b97deb",
      "translationZh": "了解我们的 NSS 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bad9989e941d144",
      "translationZh": "Neural Super Sampling (NSS) 是 Arm 开发的一种用于实时时域超级采样的参数预测模型，已针对移动 GPU 中的 Neural Accelerators (NX) 上的执行进行了优化。它通过从低分辨率时域输入中重建高质量输出帧，以更低的计算成本实现高分辨率渲染。NSS 尤其适用于移动游戏、XR 以及其他受功耗限制的图形使用场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6cb21cd989013d6",
      "translationZh": "立即开始使用我们的 NSS 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6114dbd78b0b6e72",
      "translationZh": "如果您想深入了解，请查看以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bcf2ba314c3af7da",
      "translationZh": "💻 技术博客：Neural Super Sampling 的工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7295b3dbccefd6fe",
      "translationZh": "📃 白皮书：为明天而构建：立即通过 Unreal 插件和 ML extensions for Vulkan 尝试 Neural Super Sampling",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4d44ea2736873466",
      "translationZh": "📲 技术博客：动手试用 NSS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "39d06533cdd1687f",
      "translationZh": "我们如何训练模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78d45ff6220a570f",
      "translationZh": "了解 Neural Graphics Dataset：它包含一系列参考图像和图像序列，以及训练、验证和测试神经超采样算法所需的相应运动、深度及其他数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aacca9c24c6478e5",
      "translationZh": "当前版本的数据集包含一组有限的 Neural Super Sampling 数据，用于演示 NSS 模型开发流程如何运作。虽然这一流程尚未提供可用于完整模型训练或重新训练的全面数据集，但敬请关注 Neural Graphics Model Gym 的后续版本，届时 Arm 将提供用于采集和转换内容的工具，以供模型训练和重新训练使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c1d43d310467236",
      "translationZh": "立即开始动手试用 NSS！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "761a6122130ef860",
      "translationZh": "NSS 已通过两个插件集成到 Unreal Engine 中，分别是 NSS Plugin for Unreal® Engine 和 Unreal® NNE Plugin for ML extensions for Vulkan。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f913fd7f27676813",
      "translationZh": "有关如何在 Unreal® Engine 中使用 NSS 的分步说明，请参阅我们的学习路径：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
